{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n  <body><img src=\"https://fs.mingpao.com/ins/20260510/s00024/9fdfc26188f34225a6c2d2124c83d0d5.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:1em\">\n    <p>黑龍江進入春夏之交，不同花卉綻放，入夜或清晨星河橫貫長空，花影星光互相輝映，天地共繪出一幅幅浪漫詩意畫卷。（新華社）<br/> </p>\n  </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-10T06:37:40.510608+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":58,"images":1,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none"}}